    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<p>Wandering with Wonder, written and created by Samantha Whelan Kotkas with original compositions by Chris Andrew, Jordan Andrew, Matt Epp, Sherryl Sewepegeham, and Walter MacDonald White Bear, tells the tale of a girl, Wonder, who loses her song and<br />\nlooks to her friends Turtle, Bear, Beaver, and Eagle to help her find it. Through this story with film by Roadwest Pictures, we learn we all have a little Wonder in each of us, which allows us to speak to the animals and listen to the trees. And when we are silent, we can hear our songs in the wind.</p>\n"
      }
    ]
