        "@value": "The Orchestra and conductor Tristan Rais-Sherman celebrate some of the most iconic film scores of all time from Grammy and Academy Award-winning composer Hans Zimmer! We'll travel to the deepest depths of space with music from Dune and Interstellar, join Captain Jack Sparrow and The Pirates of the Caribbean, roam Gotham with The Dark Knight, and much more."
      }
